        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b01d3958-47d7-45cd-944b-d5107c8724b1).Image",
        "Description": "Fun fact, it seems that Blueberry Muffins and other food items deal a small bit of damage to NPCs when you hit them. That means you can kill NPCs with non-lethal and/or non-pacifying items. Here is a contract demonstrating this; you don&apos;t even need to KO an NPC to do it.\r\rHint: Try using pistol shots at various parts of the body to deal damage to the NPC, then use the Muffin to peform the finishing blow.\r\rIdea credit to @volvomodus in his video &quot;3 minutes of random information about Hitman 3.&quot;",
